meta {
  name: GET Connected Devices
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/api/v1/devices/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  Lists authorizations and synchronization progress for the customer JWT. lastSyncRequestedAt is a request timestamp; lastPullCompletedAt is pull completion; syncedThrough is the frozen upper bound of the completed pull window. lastSuccessfulSync may also advance after webhook normalization and analytics. Poll with backoff; this endpoint does not download history.
  Additive fields: lastCheckedAt is a successful pull completion; latestMeasurementAt is the actual observation timestamp, never a request or delivery timestamp. lastDataProcessedAt is processing time.
  syncProgress contains operation, status, message, reason, nextRetryAt, recoveryAction and per-domain syncState/hasStoredMeasurements/newMeasurementsProcessed. Status is queued, processing, waiting, completed, completed_no_new_data, failed or skipped. These are operation metadata, not health-card states.
  diagnostics.checkedUnits/totalUnits counts date/category requests, not a percentage of health history. Read the dashboard/domain endpoint for approved card states, units and current values. Never infer Unsupported from an empty pull.
}
